CORE
test.c
--nondet-volatile-write-model data:observe_data --nondet-volatile-write-model cmd:observe_cmd --mmio-weak
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
data committed before GO: FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
--
Weak device memory (--mmio-weak): without a barrier between the two register
writes, the device may observe the command before the write to the data
register is committed (posted-write reordering), so the ordering assertion in
the write model fails.
